The .c/.h/.dts files in this directory are modified Linux kernel sources,
taken from Kobo's GPL release of the Clara HD 4.1.15 kernel
(kobolabs/Kobo-Reader, hw/imx6sll-clara/kernel.tar.bz2).

They are GPL-2.0-only, and so are the changes made to them here. Full text:
../../LICENSES/GPL-2.0.txt

They are kept as whole files rather than patched in place so that the GPL
kernel tree itself does not have to be vendored into this repository; the
build copies them over a freshly downloaded copy of Kobo's tree.

mk_ntx_image.py is our own and is covered by the repository's BSD 2-Clause
licence (../../LICENSE).
